  "name": "kmer-profiling-hifi-trio-VGP2 (release v0.1.6)",
  "report": {
    "markdown": "# Workflow 2 : Kmer Profiling \n\n## GenomeScope profiles of the sequenced individual\n\n### Linear Plot\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope linear plot (child)\")\n```\n\n### Log Plot\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope log plot (child)\")\n```\n\n### Transformed linear Plot\n\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope transformed linear plot (child)\")\n```\n\n\n### Transformed log Plot\n\n\r\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope transformed log plot (child)\")\n```\r\n\n\n## GenomeScope profiles of the maternal individual\n\n### Linear Plot\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope linear plot (maternal)\")\n```\n\n### Log Plot\n\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope log plot (maternal)\")\n```\n\n\n## GenomeScope profiles of the paternal individual\n\n### Linear Plot\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope linear plot (paternal)\")\n```\n\n### Log Plot\n\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"GenomeScope log plot (paternal)\")\n```"
  },
